icient color contrast of 1.99 (foreground color: #a5b4fc, background color: #ffffff, font size: 9.0pt (12px), font weight: normal). Expected contrast ratio of 4.5:1"},{"s":"Fix any of the following:\n  Element has insufficient color contrast of 1.48 (foreground color: #cbd5e1, background color: #ffffff, font size: 9.0pt (12px), font weight: normal). Expected contrast ratio of 4.5:1"},{"s":"Fix any of the following:\n  Element has insufficient color contrast of 1.99 (foreground color: #a5b4fc, background color: #ffffff, font size: 9.0pt (12px), font weight: normal). Expected contrast ratio of 4.5:1"}],"id":4}},{"k":"html","v":{"a":[{"s":"<span class=\"text-xs text-slate-300\" aria-live=\"polite\">Step 2 of 5</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block\">Power</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block\">Decision</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block\">Review</span>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">The Red Planet — our closest neighbor.</p>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-400\">Gravity: </span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-400\">Temp: </span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-400\">Atmosphere: </span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-400\">Travel: </span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] bg-red-500/10 text-red-300 border border-red-500/20\">⚠️ dust storms</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] bg-red-500/10 text-red-300 border border-red-500/20\">⚠️ radiation</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] bg-red-500/10 text-red-300 border border-red-500/20\">⚠️ thin atmosphere</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] bg-red-500/10 text-red-300 border border-red-500/20\">⚠️ cold</span>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-300\">📂 Mission Dossier</div>"},{"s":"<span class=\"rounded-full border border-indigo-600 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-200\">Risk: training</span>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-200 mb-2\">Can the crew survive Mars while turning dust storms into evidence about geology?</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-cyan-300\">Arrival</div>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug mt-1\">Confirm orbit, comms, and immediate dust storms controls.</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-cyan-300\">Survey</div>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug mt-1\">Collect evidence for geology while protecting O2 and hull margins.</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-cyan-300\">Departure</div>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug mt-1\">Prioritize samples, return trajectory, and what evidence is strong enough to bring home.</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-cyan-200\">geology</div>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug\">What does geology reveal about Mars?</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-cyan-200\">astrobiology</div>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug\">What does astrobiology reveal about Mars?</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-cyan-200\">atmospheric science</div>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug\">What does atmospheric science reveal about Mars?</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-cyan-200\">Optional practice • launch remains available</div>"},{"s":"<p id=\"se-interior-help\" class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Choose a compartment, compare movement methods, then select a restraint setup for its activity. In microgravity, weightlessness removes foot friction — not mass or inertia.</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-xs font-black text-cyan-100\">Readiness checklist</div>"},{"s":"<div role=\"listitem\" data-spaceexplorer-readiness-requirement=\"activities\" data-requirement-complete=\"false\" class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] text-slate-100\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">○</span>1 of 2 activities</div>"},{"s":"<div role=\"listitem\" data-spaceexplorer-readiness-requirement=\"moves\" data-requirement-complete=\"false\" class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] text-slate-100\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">○</span>1 of 2 controlled moves</div>"},{"s":"<div data-spaceexplorer-maneuver-safe=\"1\" class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-orange-200\">1 maneuver-safe</div>"},{"s":"<div data-spaceexplorer-work-corrections=\"1\" class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-200\">1 work correction</div>"},{"s":"<button type=\"button\" data-spaceexplorer-interior-view=\"route\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"se-interior-visual-panel\" class=\"rounded-md border px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold border-slate-500 bg-slate-800 text-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-700\">Route map</button>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-300\">Current: </span>"},{"s":"<strong data-spaceexplorer-interior-position=\"lab\" class=\"text-green-200\">Science lab</strong>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-300\">Final goal: </span>"},{"s":"<strong data-spaceexplorer-final-target=\"medbay\" class=\"text-purple-200\">Medical bay</strong>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-300\">Payload: </span>"},{"s":"<strong class=\"text-yellow-100\">○ Hands free • 0 kg • 1.00× inertia</strong>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-300\">Condition: </span>"},{"s":"<strong data-spaceexplorer-interior-condition-status=\"maneuver\" class=\"text-orange-200\">🛰️ Station maneuver</strong>"},{"s":"<div data-spaceexplorer-work-visual-summary=\"stabilized\" class=\"col-span-2 border-t border-cyan-800 pt-1 font-bold text-cyan-100\">Rail 04 brace + Waist restraint + Specimen tether → stable work.</div>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block text-xs font-bold\">🧭 Flight deck</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Confirm the attitude reference and secure the command tablet.</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block text-xs font-bold\">🧪 Science lab</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Activity complete</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Stow the medical kit and brace the patient restraint.</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block text-xs font-bold\">⚙️ Engineering</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Inspect the oxygen scrubber and lock the tool pouch.</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block text-xs font-bold\">⚓ Stable cabin</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Predictable short crossings</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Changing reference + added drift</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300\">Same speed • more mass = more braking distance</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">0 kg • 1.00× inertia</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block text-xs font-black\">🧪 Specimen bag</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">4 kg • 1.15× inertia</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block text-xs font-black\">🧰 Tool case</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">10 kg • 1.35× inertia</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"block text-[11px] text-slate-300\">See control predictions before moving.</span>"},{"s":"<button type=\"button\" data-spaceexplorer-prediction-mode=\"challenge\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold border-slate-500 bg-slate-800 text-slate-100\">Predict first</button>"},{"s":"<div id=\"se-interior-route-preview\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Current interior route\" data-spaceexplorer-interior-route-preview=\"maneuver\" class=\"mt-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-600 bg-slate-900 p-2 text-[11px] text-slate-100\">"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Slowest • continuous contact</span>"},{"s":"<span data-spaceexplorer-interior-prediction=\"rail\" data-predicted-control=\"controlled\" class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] font-bold text-green-200\">Controlled arrival predicted • 0.08 m/s • stop about 0.00 m</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Coast, then counter-push</span>"},{"s":"<span data-spaceexplorer-interior-prediction=\"gentle\" data-predicted-control=\"controlled\" class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] font-bold text-green-200\">Controlled arrival predicted • 0.21 m/s • stop about 0.18 m</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Fast • recovery likely</span>"},{"s":"<span data-spaceexplorer-interior-prediction=\"hard\" data-predicted-control=\"recovery\" class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-200\">Recovery likely • 0.86 m/s • stop about 3.10 m</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-green-200\">✓ Secured</span>"},{"s":"<p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-100\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-100\">Task: </strong>Tether the specimen bag before opening the experiment rack.</p>"},{"s":"<strong class=\"text-cyan-100\">Task: </strong>"},{"s":"<p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300\"><strong class=\"text-amber-200\">Challenge: </strong>A loose sample keeps moving until a hand, rail, or wall stops it.</p>"},{"s":"<strong class=\"text-amber-200\">Challenge: </strong>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-slate-200\">Needs 2 control points</span>"},{"s":"<strong class=\"block text-xs text-green-100\">✓ Activity secured</strong>"},{"s":"<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] text-slate-200\">Body restraint + specimen tether • Station maneuver</span>"},{"s":"<p data-spaceexplorer-work-attempts=\"2\" class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] text-slate-300\">2 work attempts in this compartment</p>"},{"s":"<strong class=\"text-xs text-green-200\">Procedure secured</strong>"},{"s":"<p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Your body restraint supplies a reaction point while the specimen tether prevents a loose sample. Activity logged. Work in one more compartment to continue orientation.</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-100\">Station maneuver • Body restraint + specimen tether • controlled work</p>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-200\">🧭 Commander's Hypothesis</div>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-300\">20+ chars suggested</span>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-2\">Before launch, predict what will matter most. Your debrief will compare this claim against the evidence you collect.</p>"},{"s":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-400/50 text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400 focus:outline-none\">Use geology</button>"},{"s":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-400/50 text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400 focus:outline-none\">Use astrobiology</button>"},{"s":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-400/50 text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400 focus:outline-none\">Use atmospheric science</button>"},{"s":"<textarea rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"220\" placeholder=\"Example: I predict o...\" aria-label=\"Mission hypothesis\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg bg...\" style=\"\">"},{"s":"<div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] text-slate-400 text-right\">0/220</div>"},{"s":"<div class=\"text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-200\">🎯 Optional Mission Objectives</div>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-300\">Bonus science available</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-200\">🧪 Evidence chain</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[10px] text-cyan-200\">+20 science</span>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug mt-1\">Connect observations to at least two dossier science goals.</p>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-200\">⭐ Decision discipline</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[10px] text-cyan-200\">+15 science</span>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug mt-1\">Make at least two optimal evidence-based decisions.</p>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-200\">🛡️ Safe return margin</span>"},{"s":"<span class=\"text-[10px] text-cyan-200\">+20 science</span>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-snug mt-1\">Finish with O2 and Hull both at or above 25%.</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-bold mb-2\">👨‍🚀 YOUR CREW</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Commander</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-indigo-300 italic\">\"Stay calm, think clearly, act decisively.\"</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Geologist</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-indigo-300 italic\">\"Every rock tells a story billions of years old.\"</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Biologist</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-indigo-300 italic\">\"If there's water, there might be life.\"</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Engineer</p>"},{"s":"<p class=\"text-[11px] text-indigo-300 italic\">\"Redundancy isn't paranoia — it's survival.\"</p>"}],"id":5}}],"id":2}],"id":1}},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@328"}
